                        "Name": "Four 1t Ammo Boxes",
                        "Details": "You consider the supplies spread across the Armory. \"Four single-ton ammunition boxes. One ton each.\"\r\n\r\nJarl nods. \"Four boxes will give us a some reserves. Fifty shells per ton means we can keep the Lutefisk Launcher supplied for short missions without dedicating too much storage space to the ammunition.\"\r\n\r\nHe gestures toward the Smoker. \"I'll make all of them Smokey Lutefisk Ammo. The Smoker residue will give each shell its obscuring effect when it detonates.\"\r\n\r\nYou authorize the expenditure of ¢168,000 C-Bills.\r\n\r\nJarl immediately returns to work, beginning the process of preparing the ammunition for storage.\r\n\r\n<color=#f69c24>[[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] cannot create more ammo for 14 days and is unavailable for 14 days</color>"
