                        "Id": "outcome_2_0",
                        "Name": "Create Two 2t Ammo Boxes",
                        "Details": "You consider the larger ammunition boxes. \"Two double-ton ammunition boxes. How many shells can you fit in them?\"\r\n\r\nJarl looks over the supplies and considers the available space. \"Normally, I'd expect a two-ton bin to hold fifty shells per ton, so one hundred shells. But these larger boxes have a little more usable space than the standard single-ton containers. I think I can squeeze another fifteen shells between the existing storage racks.\"\r\n\r\nYou raise an eyebrow. \"So, 115 shells?\"\r\n\r\nJarl nods confidently. \"115 shells across the two bins. It will be tight, but the additional space in the larger containers gives me enough room.\" He glances toward the Smoker. \"And all of them will be Smokey Lutefisk Ammo. The residue from the Smoker will create the obscuring cloud when the shells explode.\"\r\n\r\nYou authorize the expenditure of ¢210,000 C-Bills.\r\n\r\nJarl immediately begins preparing the ammunition for storage, already calculating how to make every cubic centimetre of the larger bins count.\r\n\r\n<color=#f69c24>[[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] cannot create more ammo for 14 days and is unavailable for 14 days</color>"
