                        "Id": "outcome_3_0",
                        "Name": "Maybe Another Time",
                        "Details": "You look at the supplies, then at the projected expense. \"Not yet. Put the production on hold for four weeks. The costs are too high right now.\"\r\n\r\nJarl looks disappointed but nods. \"Very well, Commander. The ingredients will keep, and I can resume the process when you've decided we can afford it.\" He looks toward the Smoker. \"The device can wait as well. Once we resume production, I can continue adding the smokey residue to the Lutefisk Ammo and give the shells their obscuring effect.\"\r\n\r\nYou leave Jarl to clean up the Armory, wondering whether the <i>Argo</i> will ever stop smelling like fermented goat's milk, lutefisk, and freshly smoked wood.\r\n\r\n<color=#f69c24>[[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]'s project is on hold and {SCN_MW.Subj} cannot create more ammo for 28 days</color>"
